{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Conquest is an Tower Defense game with Deckbuilding and Roguelite elements. Combine Spells, Towers and Units to create a Deck and defeat your enemies. Gather powerful Relics of various rarities that enhance your Cards. Spend your Resources wisely and find balance between offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your own Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Gold on your adventures and use it to unlock new Cards. The further you manage to travel the more Gold you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spell Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spells grant utilities such as drawing new Cards, replenishing Mana. <br>Use them wisely, Sapphires are scarce Resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tower Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build Towers to defend your Siege Camp from approaching enemies.<br>Some apply Debuffs to Enemies, some apply Buffs to your other Towers. <br>Create efficient defense by combining them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Unit Cards</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Units to siege Enemy Base.<br>Some are strong, some are durable, some apply Buffs to others.<br>Combine them to create powerful waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find balance between offense and defense.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather Relics from fallen Enemy Bases to boost your Towers, Units or weaken your enemies. Relics come in varying rarities, on your travels you may find Altars where you can sacrifice Relics to receive ones with higher rarity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your handcrafted Deck and random Relics make every run unique. Tinker with your Deck, select matching Relics to travel further than ever before.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883580?t=1753871104","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883580?t=1753871104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/53f92365810312b589a370bb8d6a10ac7c7b0a4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753871104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/53f92365810312b589a370bb8d6a10ac7c7b0a4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753871104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Conquest is an Tower Defense game with Deckbuilding and Roguelite elements. Combine Spells, Towers and Units to create a Deck and defeat your enemies. Gather powerful Relics of various rarities that enhance your Cards. Spend your Resources wisely and find balance between offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your own Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Gold on your adventures and use it to unlock new Cards. The further you manage to travel the more Gold you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spell Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9e8d5eaa2445ef379b0ae4ed617234c9.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spells grant utilities such as drawing new Cards, replenishing Mana. <br>Use them wisely, Sapphires are scarce Resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tower Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/dd06bdad2a00f6ef5f2553805e55d361.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build Towers to defend your Siege Camp from approaching enemies.<br>Some apply Debuffs to Enemies, some apply Buffs to your other Towers. <br>Create efficient defense by combining them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Unit Cards</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/9469f001264e2148a492f5d93f117e5b.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit Units to siege Enemy Base.<br>Some are strong, some are durable, some apply Buffs to others.<br>Combine them to create powerful waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find balance between offense and defense.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.poster.avif?t=1753871104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.webm?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/494685f43481a7ccde05b01fd7ee5b64.mp4?t=1753871104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather Relics from fallen Enemy Bases to boost your Towers, Units or weaken your enemies. Relics come in varying rarities, on your travels you may find Altars where you can sacrifice Relics to receive ones with higher rarity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your handcrafted Deck and random Relics make every run unique. Tinker with your Deck, select matching Relics to travel further than ever before.</p>","developers":["YaxWorks"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/4598a34bb45b10ad20b37dde6a330b375f4eb833/header.jpg?t=1753871104","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","